    {
      "text": "Nephites to pass into third and fourth generation after Christ’s appearance before iniquity arises, 1 Ne. 12:11–12 (2 Ne. 26:9; Alma 45:12; 3 Ne. 27:32; 4 Ne. 1:22–24). Lehi1 prophesies about future generations, 2 Ne. 4:2. in future generations seed of Nephites shall become righteous branch unto Israel, 2 Ne. 9:53. God visits iniquities of fathers upon children unto third and fourth generations, Mosiah 13:13 (Deut. 5:9). who shall declare his generation, Mosiah 14:8 (15:10; Isa. 53:8). O ye wicked and perverse generation, Alma 9:8 (10:17, 25; Hel. 13:29). the Lord will preserve records, that he might show his power unto future generations, Alma 37:14, 18–19. fourth generation of enemies shall visit Nephites’ destruction, Hel. 13:10. Christ gives Nephites scriptures so that future generations will have them, 3 Ne. 26:2. God’s word shall hiss forth from generation to generation, Moro. 10:28.",
